  "solution": "Máy thu nhận tín hiệu sớm nhất khi khoảng cách từ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> đến đường thẳng là ngắn nhất, tức là điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math> là hình chiếu vuông góc của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> lên đường thẳng.<br>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover><mi>n</mi><mo accent=\"true\">→</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> là véc-tơ pháp tuyến của đường thẳng.<br>Ta có khoảng cách từ <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> đến đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math> là \n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><msqrt><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">|</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">|</mo></mrow><msqrt><mn>13</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>13</mn><msqrt><mn>13</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>13</mn></msqrt><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tGọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math> là hình chiếu của <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> lên đường thẳng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Khi đó tọa độ điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>Δ</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow></semantics></math> với <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Δ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">qua </mtext><mspace width=\"0.333em\"/></mrow><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"normal\">vuông góc </mtext><mspace width=\"0.333em\"/></mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>⇒</mo><mi>Δ</mi><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow></semantics></math><br><math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>Δ</mi></semantics></math> qua <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>11</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Tọa độ điểm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>M</mi></semantics></math> là nghiệm của hệ phương trình \n\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow><mo>⇔</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\tVậy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.",
